{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Conquer and Corrupt the Heavenly Realm as Lilith in this Frenetic Roguelike Horde Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unjustly banished for defying a rotten divine order, Lilith rises from the depths of the underworld with a single goal: Corrupt the heavenly realm and restore true balance between good and evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face endless hordes of celestial enemies, channel and combine the power of the Seven Deadly Sins, and transform every corner of heaven into your own domain. Only you can corrupt paradise and ascend as the supreme queen of the celestial plane.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CORRUPT PARADISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/Dise\u00f1o_sin_t\u00edtulo__3_.gif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/ceb9110b411eeb0760999d15fd4660da.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div>Unleash the devastating power of corruption and watch it spread like an unstoppable plague. Defeat celestial legions, claim territory, and transform each conquered zone into a dark reflection of your will. <strong>Control the map</strong>: the more corruption you spread, the stronger your abilities become\u2026 and the closer you get to the celestial throne.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR ATTACK STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/Ataque.gif?t=1751647468\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/f64fc598eefce268191e642c118c46a0.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div>Before each run, choose between two combat styles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your distance with long-range attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the chaos of close-quarters melee</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your fighting style changes not only your playstyle, but the challenges you face, the Sins you\u2019ll unlock, and how you survive the divine onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WIELD THE POWER OF THE SEVEN DEADLY SINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/253cf80a894ceb1db77479173478bda0.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/b6c437e100c6491ac52eca19c77f4171.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout each run, shape your combat style by channeling and combining the power of the Seven Deadly Sins.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Sin is a unique ability that transforms your way of fighting, modifying your attacks, changing how corruption affects the environment and enemies, and leaving a dark mark on the Heavenly Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine sins, dominate the hordes, and adapt your strategy in a battlefield that\u2019s constantly evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heaven won\u2019t be redeemed... it will be conquered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KNOW YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/4e41fa2d4f35f39d1191c75532a36618.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heaven\u2019s champions won\u2019t fall easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each enemy type has unique patterns, abilities, and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Observe. Learn. Exploit. Turn divine tactics against them and twist their strength into your weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STAY IN CONTROL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/8d82448b60838eed419aff3d4945e141.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive massive waves of divine enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use corruption tactically to slow their advance and combine powerful sin abilities to always maintain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587510?t=1751647468","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587510?t=1751647468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/5719d4896711b0bd20155f97b4d60e6e4fed927a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751647468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/5719d4896711b0bd20155f97b4d60e6e4fed927a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751647468","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Conquer and Corrupt the Heavenly Realm as Lilith in this Frenetic Roguelike Horde Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unjustly banished for defying a rotten divine order, Lilith rises from the depths of the underworld with a single goal: Corrupt the heavenly realm and restore true balance between good and evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face endless hordes of celestial enemies, channel and combine the power of the Seven Deadly Sins, and transform every corner of heaven into your own domain. Only you can corrupt paradise and ascend as the supreme queen of the celestial plane.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CORRUPT PARADISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/Dise\u00f1o_sin_t\u00edtulo__3_.gif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/ceb9110b411eeb0760999d15fd4660da.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div>Unleash the devastating power of corruption and watch it spread like an unstoppable plague. Defeat celestial legions, claim territory, and transform each conquered zone into a dark reflection of your will. <strong>Control the map</strong>: the more corruption you spread, the stronger your abilities become\u2026 and the closer you get to the celestial throne.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR ATTACK STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/Ataque.gif?t=1751647468\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/f64fc598eefce268191e642c118c46a0.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div>Before each run, choose between two combat styles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your distance with long-range attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the chaos of close-quarters melee</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your fighting style changes not only your playstyle, but the challenges you face, the Sins you\u2019ll unlock, and how you survive the divine onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WIELD THE POWER OF THE SEVEN DEADLY SINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/253cf80a894ceb1db77479173478bda0.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/b6c437e100c6491ac52eca19c77f4171.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout each run, shape your combat style by channeling and combining the power of the Seven Deadly Sins.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Sin is a unique ability that transforms your way of fighting, modifying your attacks, changing how corruption affects the environment and enemies, and leaving a dark mark on the Heavenly Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine sins, dominate the hordes, and adapt your strategy in a battlefield that\u2019s constantly evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heaven won\u2019t be redeemed... it will be conquered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KNOW YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/4e41fa2d4f35f39d1191c75532a36618.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heaven\u2019s champions won\u2019t fall easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each enemy type has unique patterns, abilities, and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Observe. Learn. Exploit. Turn divine tactics against them and twist their strength into your weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STAY IN CONTROL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/extras/8d82448b60838eed419aff3d4945e141.avif?t=1751647468\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive massive waves of divine enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use corruption tactically to slow their advance and combine powerful sin abilities to always maintain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Flaming Dogs Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587510/c1df15421a9bf980edd3bd19a744b4ff99005eb1/header.jpg?t=1751647468","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152482,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152482/movie480.mp4?t=1749236882","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152482/movie_max.mp4?t=1749236882"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152482/16c9b259fb2a3a4ac0746ace5ca2143d1bb22f6e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749236882","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152482/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749236882","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152482/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749236882"}}],"name":"Lilith: Rise of the Fallen","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li>